        "summary": "修改VDC",
        "x-resource": "租户管理",
        "description": "更新VDC。\n\ncurl命令调用示例:\n```\ncurl -v -H \"Content-Type:application/json\" -H \"x-auth-token: ******\" -X PUT -d \"{json}\" \"https://{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.1/vdcs/{vdc_id}\"\n```\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|60次/分钟|\n|吞吐量|10次/秒|\n|TP50请求时延|1500ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|3000ms|",
        "x-precautions": "错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > VDC特性”章节。",
        "tags": [
          "VDC"
        ],
        "operationId": "UpdateDomainOrVDC",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
